sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Cli
  participant S as Shrinker
  participant W as TreeWalker
  participant D as ShrinkDatabase
  participant P as MediaProbe
  participant E as HevcEncoder
  participant F as ffmpeg
  U->>C: mediatools shrink PATH
  C->>U: confirm replace originals?
  U-->>C: y
  C->>S: run()
  loop every directory
    S->>W: walk(root) (skips _flat, newShrinkedFiles)
    S->>D: ensure() (create / migrate)
    loop every video
      S->>D: is_done(path)?
      alt recorded
        D-->>S: yes -> skip
      else not recorded
        S->>P: video_codec(path)
        alt hevc
          S->>D: record(path)
        else other codec
          S->>E: encode(path, tmp)
          E->>F: ffmpeg -vcodec libx265 -crf 28
          F-->>E: exit code
          E->>P: has_video / duration (validate)
          E-->>S: ok?
          opt ok and not keep_copies
            S->>S: copyfile(tmp, path) same inode
            S->>D: record(path)
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
  S-->>C: exit code 0 / 1 / 2
